  <p id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廢帝諱<persName id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0003" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs">伯宗</persName>，字<persName id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0007" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs">奉業</persName>，小字<persName id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p001:m0012" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs">藥王</persName>，世祖嫡長子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋七月戊申，立皇子<persName id="c-chenshu-004-zhize-son-of-bozong:p002:m0009" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs_A">至澤</persName>為皇太子，</p>
